    "name": "Nocturnal Quest",
    "steam_appid": 2330930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturnal Quest is a Semi-Idle RPG game. Players recruit heroes, kill monsters, craft weapons &amp; armor, advance talent trees, enchant/reforge equipment, discover mysterious gems, and finally assemble the most powerful adventure teams!<br><br><strong>Please note before purchase: Idle play is one of the main components of this game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-idle game with deep and complex itemization systems to support endless character builds!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 6 adventurer classes to choose from. Every class has 2 specializations, with 3 spells each.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based + Real-Time battle system: During battles, each unit takes its turn according to its initiative stat. However, triggered effects, buff/debuff ticks, and regeneration happen in &quot;real time&quot;. This unique system allows for deep strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than 100 different active and passive skills to experiment with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchant, Reforge, and Transfer systems allow high customization of adventurers\u2019 equipment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep gem system and a variety of set bonuses to further expand your strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 types of monsters among 6 different maps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract residents and conduct explorations to further expand your town!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturnal Quest is a Semi-Idle RPG game. Players recruit heroes, kill monsters, craft weapons &amp; armor, advance talent trees, enchant/reforge equipment, discover mysterious gems, and finally assemble the most powerful adventure teams!<br><br><strong>Please note before purchase: Idle play is one of the main components of this game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-idle game with deep and complex itemization systems to support endless character builds!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 6 adventurer classes to choose from. Every class has 2 specializations, with 3 spells each.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based + Real-Time battle system: During battles, each unit takes its turn according to its initiative stat. However, triggered effects, buff/debuff ticks, and regeneration happen in &quot;real time&quot;. This unique system allows for deep strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than 100 different active and passive skills to experiment with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchant, Reforge, and Transfer systems allow high customization of adventurers\u2019 equipment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep gem system and a variety of set bonuses to further expand your strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 types of monsters among 6 different maps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract residents and conduct explorations to further expand your town!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Nocturnal Quest is a Semi-Idle Adventure RPG with 100s of spells &amp; effects, 6 classes, 12 specializations, and countless builds. Have your teams grind gear and progress through an infinity of levels!",
